The partner 'My Cars' page already existed and aggregated cars from
multiple dealers correctly, but was missing: expense totals per car
(now shown), a Recent Movements section (the backend was already
sending this data, just never rendered), and any export capability.

Added Export (PDF/JPG/Excel) covering every assigned car with dealer,
status, price, expenses, and profit — completing the partner-side
mirror of what was already built for the dealer's view of a partner's
history earlier in this session.
